{"title":"How to Bioluminesce: Artist Ash Eliza Williams’s Reveries of Wonder","link":"https://www.themarginalian.org/2025/12/26/ash-eliza-williams-art/","date":1766798810000,"content":"<p>“Our origins are of the earth. And so there is in us a deeply seated response to the natural universe, which is part of our humanity,” <a href=\"https://www.themarginalian.org/2017/09/20/rachel-carson-lost-woods-the-real-world-around-us/\">wrote</a> Rachel Carson. “Our world, and the worlds around and within it,” <a href=\"https://www.themarginalian.org/2018/10/31/how-to-be-a-good-creature-sy-montgomery/\">wrote</a> Sy Montgomery a generation later, “is aflame with shades of brilliance we cannot fathom… far more vibrant, far more holy, than we could ever imagine.”</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://aerofauna.com\" target=\"_blank\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams1.jpg?resize=680%2C680&amp;ssl=1\" width=\"680\" height=\"680\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams1.jpg?w=1200&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams1.jpg?resize=320%2C320&amp;ssl=1 320w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams1.jpg?resize=600%2C600&amp;ssl=1 600w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams1.jpg?resize=240%2C240&amp;ssl=1 240w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams1.jpg?resize=768%2C768&amp;ssl=1 768w\" /></a></p>\n<p>There are people whose eye is more sharply focused on those brilliances, whose ear is more finely tuned to the murmurations of the mountains and the oceans and the trees, whose orientation to the world is more tenderly in touch with our creaturely origins. Some of them become artists, some scientists, and some boundary-spanners who refuse the divide, who know that to partition our ways of seeing is to keep ourselves from apprehending the magnificent whole. </p>\n<p>Growing up in the Blue Ridge Mountains, a child so shy as to dream of being able to communicate via bioluminescence, <a href=\"https://aerofauna.com\" target=\"_blank\">Ash Eliza Williams</a> came to realize that, lacking the luciferin necessary for the language of light, the human animal has evolved its own alchemical means of silent communication: art. </p>\n<p><a href=\"https://aerofauna.com\" target=\"_blank\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_carson9.jpg?resize=680%2C510&amp;ssl=1\" width=\"680\" height=\"510\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_carson9.jpg?w=869&amp;ssl=1 869w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_carson9.jpg?resize=320%2C240&amp;ssl=1 320w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_carson9.jpg?resize=600%2C450&amp;ssl=1 600w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_carson9.jpg?resize=240%2C180&amp;ssl=1 240w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_carson9.jpg?resize=768%2C576&amp;ssl=1 768w\" /></a></p>\n<p>Animated by “a fascination with alternative languages and methods of connection,” Williams draws on medieval bestiaries and geophysics, on 19th-century zoological illustrations and graphic novels, to conjure up the wonder Rachel Carson <a href=\"https://www.themarginalian.org/2022/11/30/rachel-carson-national-book-award-speech/\">insisted</a> is our inheritance and our best protection from ourselves. Emanating from the paintings and sculptures are the “endless forms most beautiful and most wonderful” that enchanted Darwin — from bioluminescent moths to the bat (that <a href=\"https://www.themarginalian.org/2025/07/11/bats/\">living triumph of the possible over the probable</a>), from chlorophyl (that <a href=\"https://www.themarginalian.org/2021/10/26/why-leaves-change-color/\">ongoing mystery</a> of chemistry and chance) to clouds (those abiding <a href=\"https://www.themarginalian.org/2024/07/13/cloudspotting-for-beginners/\">spells against indifference</a>) — arranged in series whose very titles are miniature poems, titles like <a href=\"https://aerofauna.com/urgent-beings/\" target=\"_blank\"><em>Urgent Beings</em></a> and <a href=\"https://aerofauna.com/phenomena/\" target=\"_blank\"><em>The History of Weather</em></a>.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://aerofauna.com\" target=\"_blank\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_clouds.jpg?resize=680%2C839&amp;ssl=1\" width=\"680\" height=\"839\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_clouds.jpg?w=973&amp;ssl=1 973w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_clouds.jpg?resize=320%2C395&amp;ssl=1 320w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_clouds.jpg?resize=600%2C740&amp;ssl=1 600w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_clouds.jpg?resize=240%2C296&amp;ssl=1 240w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_clouds.jpg?resize=768%2C947&amp;ssl=1 768w\" /></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://aerofauna.com\" target=\"_blank\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_sunspot.jpg?resize=680%2C850&amp;ssl=1\" width=\"680\" height=\"850\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_sunspot.jpg?w=1536&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_sunspot.jpg?resize=320%2C400&amp;ssl=1 320w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_sunspot.jpg?resize=600%2C750&amp;ssl=1 600w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_sunspot.jpg?resize=240%2C300&amp;ssl=1 240w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_sunspot.jpg?resize=768%2C960&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_sunspot.jpg?resize=1229%2C1536&amp;ssl=1 1229w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_sunspot.jpg?w=1360&amp;ssl=1 1360w\" /></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://aerofauna.com\" target=\"_blank\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_bat.jpg?resize=680%2C871&amp;ssl=1\" width=\"680\" height=\"871\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_bat.jpg?w=1440&amp;ssl=1 1440w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_bat.jpg?resize=320%2C410&amp;ssl=1 320w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_bat.jpg?resize=600%2C768&amp;ssl=1 600w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_bat.jpg?resize=240%2C307&amp;ssl=1 240w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_bat.jpg?resize=768%2C983&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_bat.jpg?resize=1199%2C1536&amp;ssl=1 1199w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_bat.jpg?w=1360&amp;ssl=1 1360w\" /></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DP5ASZHEQ5B/?img_index=3\" target=\"_blank\">One</a> began as a book about Rachel Carson and instead became a series of durational paintings about the lives of different creatures — a starling, a violet-eared waxbill, an orange fruit-dove, a hickory tree — using the graphic novel format to explore their experience of time, “to think,” Williams writes, “about the expansiveness or endlessness of a creature’s Umwelt.”</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://aerofauna.com\" target=\"_blank\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_carson1.jpg?resize=680%2C502&amp;ssl=1\" width=\"680\" height=\"502\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_carson1.jpg?w=900&amp;ssl=1 900w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_carson1.jpg?resize=320%2C236&amp;ssl=1 320w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_carson1.jpg?resize=600%2C443&amp;ssl=1 600w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_carson1.jpg?resize=240%2C177&amp;ssl=1 240w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_carson1.jpg?resize=768%2C567&amp;ssl=1 768w\" /></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://aerofauna.com\" target=\"_blank\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_carson3.jpg?resize=680%2C512&amp;ssl=1\" width=\"680\" height=\"512\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_carson3.jpg?w=1200&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_carson3.jpg?resize=320%2C241&amp;ssl=1 320w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_carson3.jpg?resize=600%2C452&amp;ssl=1 600w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_carson3.jpg?resize=240%2C181&amp;ssl=1 240w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_carson3.jpg?resize=768%2C578&amp;ssl=1 768w\" /></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://aerofauna.com\" target=\"_blank\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_carson4.jpg?resize=680%2C512&amp;ssl=1\" width=\"680\" height=\"512\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_carson4.jpg?w=1200&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_carson4.jpg?resize=320%2C241&amp;ssl=1 320w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_carson4.jpg?resize=600%2C452&amp;ssl=1 600w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_carson4.jpg?resize=240%2C181&amp;ssl=1 240w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_carson4.jpg?resize=768%2C578&amp;ssl=1 768w\" /></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://aerofauna.com\" target=\"_blank\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_carson2.jpg?resize=680%2C508&amp;ssl=1\" width=\"680\" height=\"508\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_carson2.jpg?w=1200&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_carson2.jpg?resize=320%2C239&amp;ssl=1 320w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_carson2.jpg?resize=600%2C448&amp;ssl=1 600w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_carson2.jpg?resize=240%2C179&amp;ssl=1 240w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_carson2.jpg?resize=768%2C573&amp;ssl=1 768w\" /></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://aerofauna.com\" target=\"_blank\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_carson.jpg?resize=680%2C509&amp;ssl=1\" width=\"680\" height=\"509\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_carson.jpg?w=1200&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_carson.jpg?resize=320%2C239&amp;ssl=1 320w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_carson.jpg?resize=600%2C449&amp;ssl=1 600w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_carson.jpg?resize=240%2C180&amp;ssl=1 240w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_carson.jpg?resize=768%2C575&amp;ssl=1 768w\" /></a></p>\n<p>Thoroughly enchanted as I am by all of this work, none thrills me more than Williams’s painted reveries of lichen, that <a href=\"https://www.themarginalian.org/2025/11/02/lichen/\">uncommon teacher in how to be better humans</a>.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://aerofauna.com\" target=\"_blank\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_lichen11.jpg?resize=680%2C492&amp;ssl=1\" width=\"680\" height=\"492\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_lichen11.jpg?w=700&amp;ssl=1 700w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_lichen11.jpg?resize=320%2C231&amp;ssl=1 320w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_lichen11.jpg?resize=600%2C434&amp;ssl=1 600w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_lichen11.jpg?resize=240%2C173&amp;ssl=1 240w\" /></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://aerofauna.com\" target=\"_blank\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_lichen10.jpg?resize=680%2C716&amp;ssl=1\" width=\"680\" height=\"716\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_lichen10.jpg?w=680&amp;ssl=1 680w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_lichen10.jpg?resize=320%2C337&amp;ssl=1 320w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_lichen10.jpg?resize=600%2C632&amp;ssl=1 600w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_lichen10.jpg?resize=240%2C253&amp;ssl=1 240w\" /></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://aerofauna.com\" target=\"_blank\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_lichen9.jpg?resize=680%2C850&amp;ssl=1\" width=\"680\" height=\"850\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_lichen9.jpg?w=800&amp;ssl=1 800w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_lichen9.jpg?resize=320%2C400&amp;ssl=1 320w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_lichen9.jpg?resize=600%2C750&amp;ssl=1 600w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_lichen9.jpg?resize=240%2C300&amp;ssl=1 240w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_lichen9.jpg?resize=768%2C960&amp;ssl=1 768w\" /></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://aerofauna.com\" target=\"_blank\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_lichen1.jpg?resize=680%2C498&amp;ssl=1\" width=\"680\" height=\"498\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_lichen1.jpg?w=865&amp;ssl=1 865w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_lichen1.jpg?resize=320%2C235&amp;ssl=1 320w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_lichen1.jpg?resize=600%2C440&amp;ssl=1 600w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_lichen1.jpg?resize=240%2C176&amp;ssl=1 240w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_lichen1.jpg?resize=768%2C563&amp;ssl=1 768w\" /></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://aerofauna.com\" target=\"_blank\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_lichen2.jpg?resize=680%2C508&amp;ssl=1\" width=\"680\" height=\"508\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_lichen2.jpg?w=858&amp;ssl=1 858w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_lichen2.jpg?resize=320%2C239&amp;ssl=1 320w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_lichen2.jpg?resize=600%2C448&amp;ssl=1 600w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_lichen2.jpg?resize=240%2C179&amp;ssl=1 240w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_lichen2.jpg?resize=768%2C574&amp;ssl=1 768w\" /></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://aerofauna.com\" target=\"_blank\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_lichen7.jpg?resize=680%2C514&amp;ssl=1\" width=\"680\" height=\"514\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_lichen7.jpg?w=1381&amp;ssl=1 1381w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_lichen7.jpg?resize=320%2C242&amp;ssl=1 320w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_lichen7.jpg?resize=600%2C454&amp;ssl=1 600w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_lichen7.jpg?resize=240%2C181&amp;ssl=1 240w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_lichen7.jpg?resize=768%2C581&amp;ssl=1 768w\" /></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://aerofauna.com\" target=\"_blank\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_lichen6.jpg?resize=680%2C503&amp;ssl=1\" width=\"680\" height=\"503\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_lichen6.jpg?w=1330&amp;ssl=1 1330w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_lichen6.jpg?resize=320%2C237&amp;ssl=1 320w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_lichen6.jpg?resize=600%2C443&amp;ssl=1 600w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_lichen6.jpg?resize=240%2C177&amp;ssl=1 240w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_lichen6.jpg?resize=768%2C568&amp;ssl=1 768w\" /></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://aerofauna.com\" target=\"_blank\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_lichen13.jpg?resize=680%2C454&amp;ssl=1\" width=\"680\" height=\"454\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_lichen13.jpg?w=700&amp;ssl=1 700w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_lichen13.jpg?resize=320%2C213&amp;ssl=1 320w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_lichen13.jpg?resize=600%2C400&amp;ssl=1 600w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ashelizawilliams_lichen13.jpg?resize=240%2C160&amp;ssl=1 240w\" /></a></p>\n<p>Radiating from it all is what may be the most fruitful orientation a person can have to a world — an obsessive yet spacious curiosity that, through the pinhole of the minutest details, reveals the grandeur of the big picture. <a href=\"https://www.themarginalian.org/2025/04/24/muriel-rukeyser-willard-gibbs/\">“The whole is simpler than its parts,”</a> observed the visionary physicist Willard Gibbs in what remains the finest koan of science, but it is only by attending closely and with a great kindness to the parts, discrete yet intertwined by threads of ceaseless silent communication, that we can contact the majesty and mystery of the whole.</p>\n<hr /><h3>donating = loving</h3><p>For seventeen years, I have been spending hundreds of hours and thousands of dollars each month composing <em>The Marginalian</em> (which <a href=\"https://www.themarginalian.org/2021/10/22/brain-pickings-becoming-the-marginalian/\">bore the outgrown name <em>Brain Pickings</em></a> for its first fifteen years). It has remained free and ad-free and alive thanks to patronage from readers. I have no staff, no interns, no assistant — a thoroughly one-woman labor of love that is also my life and my livelihood. If this labor makes your own life more livable in any way, please consider lending a helping hand with a <a href=\"https://www.themarginalian.org/donate/\">donation</a>. Your support makes all the difference.</p>\n\n<hr />\n\n<h3>newsletter</h3>\n<p><em>The Marginalian</em> has a free weekly newsletter. It comes out on Sundays and offers the week’s most inspiring reading. Here’s <a href=\"https://mailchi.mp/brainpickings/janna-levin-rebecca-elson-anne-lamott-james-gleick\">what to expect</a>. Like? <a href=\"https://www.themarginalian.org/newsletter/\">Sign up.</a></p>","author":"Maria Popova","siteTitle":"The Marginalian","siteHash":"052ac1be0de11784b9ef27664fbcf33da8263d0e7cb9c6e601ccd959f2d3aa78","entryHash":"154aab2d94c9ba59618296bd926960b50dc3312734fb06d111012f08abf27b83","category":"Sites"}